    {
      "text": "Binding his foal unto the vine, Gen. 49:11. land of wheat, and barley, and vines, Deut. 8:8. their vine is of the vine of Sodom, Deut. 32:32. said the trees unto the vine, Come thou, and reign, Judg. 9:12. dwelt safely, every man under his vine, 1 Kgs. 4:25. Thou hast brought a vine out of Egypt, Ps. 80:8. planted it with the choicest vine, Isa. 5:2 (2 Ne. 15:2). I had planted thee a noble vine, Jer. 2:21. What is the vine tree more than any tree, Ezek. 15:2. Thy mother is like a vine in thy blood, Ezek. 19:10. Israel is an empty vine, Hosea 10:1. He hath laid my vine waste, Joel 1:7. they shall sit every man under his vine, Micah 4:4. neither shall your vine cast her fruit before the time, Mal. 3:11 (3 Ne. 24:11).",
